      <li><a href="#setup">The test setup</a></li>
      <li><a href="#memory">maintenance_work_mem: the 5x setting</a></li>
      <li><a href="#workers">Why parallel workers did not start</a></li>
      <li><a href="#shm">The /dev/shm error in Docker and Kubernetes</a></li>
      <li><a href="#progress">Watch a build in progress</a></li>
      <li><a href="#production">Build procedure for production</a></li>
      <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
